# Hillsbrad (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and schematics whose SOURCE is physically in
# Hillsbrad Foothills for a Horde player, verified against the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Fourteen recipes are
# vendor-sold by Horde or neutral in-zone vendors (every buy is pinned to its
# vendor); six more drop from Hillsbrad mobs with no vendor anywhere (four sole
# drops, one tight in-zone family, one named single-source drop - two of those
# droppers outlevel the zone, so those steps say to come back later). Every
# other Hillsbrad-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop. Quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no in-zone Horde source, so that is
# stated, not padded.

step Tailoring - Tarren Mill (Mallen Swain)

  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 2394 -- Mallen Swain (61.9, 20.98), Tailoring Supplies
  buy 6274 "Pattern: Blue Overalls" npc 2394
  buy 6401 "Pattern: Dark Silk Shirt" npc 2394
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag" npc 2394
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag" npc 2394
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

