step Blacksmithing - the far north (rare drop, come back later)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 48.2,1.1
  goto 50.5,1
  goto 50.5,3.7
  goto 49.3,3.7
  goto 51.6,2.3
  collect 251391 "Plans: Hard Gold Pauldrons" optional
  note Dropped only by the Crushridge Ogre (level 34), past the top of the guide band - come back at a higher level; the recipe drops nowhere else and has no vendor anywhere in the data.

step Engineering - the far north (rare drop, come back later)

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 43.2,0.5
  collect 284870 "Schematic: Unsanctified Grenade" optional
  note Dropped only by the Crushridge Warmonger (level 39), past the top of the guide band - come back at a higher level; the recipe drops nowhere else and has no vendor anywhere in the data.

step Enchanting - the Torn Fin shallows (tight family drop)

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 20.44,64.62
  goto 23.17,64.21
  goto 25.32,72.79
  goto 29.78,73.6
  goto 33.86,72.8
  goto 22.11,64.01
  goto 24.83,67.23
  goto 28.05,72.85
  goto 32.67,74.36
  goto 36.18,70.22
  goto 41.02,69.49
  goto 46.03,63.96
  collect 11152 "Formula: Enchant Gloves - Fishing" optional
  note Dropped only by the Torn Fin family (Muckdweller, Coastrunner, Tidehunter, Oracle) and Scargil, all in these shallows; the recipe has no vendor anywhere in the data. The Alliance companion omits this family - the data shows no vendor anywhere, so it ships here with the delta stated in the inventory.

step First Aid and Fishing - no Hillsbrad source

  note First Aid and Fishing have no recipe source physically in Hillsbrad Foothills for Horde players in the data - no servable in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one - so this guide carries nothing for them. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.
